# A fault of the root itself stops the system (roadmap os-server.md D8): it
# has no fault endpoint, and no one could build it again. TEST_ROOT_FAULT
# makes it execute an invalid opcode once it has built everything.
define: TEST_ROOT_FAULT
match: contains
---
rx286 PANIC: the root faulted
#UD error 0000 at 0006:{r:rx_ud2}
